<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <!-- Recipe Page - Mandatory Exercise ☑️ + Bonus Features -->
    <!-- Features: Creative styling, 12+ HTML tags, 10+ CSS properties -->
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Chicken Adobo ☑️</title>
    <style>
        /* Creative but simple professional styling - 10+ CSS properties */
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        
        body {
            font-family: 'Georgia', serif;
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 30px 20px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            background-color: #f8f4f0;
            color: #2c1810;
        }
        
        h1 {
            /* h1 - Main recipe title */
            color: #8b4513;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 2.5em;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            text-shadow: 1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        
        h2 {
            /* h2 - Section headers */
            color: #b5651d;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #d2691e;
            padding-bottom: 5px;
            margin: 30px 0 15px 0;
        }
        
        h3 {
            /* h3 - Subheader for bonus info */
            color: #a0522d;
            margin-top: 25px;
        }
        
        p {
            font-size: 1.1em;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            text-align: justify;
        }
        
        ul, ol {
            margin: 20px 0;
            padding-left: 30px;
        }
        
        li {
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            font-size: 1.05em;
        }
        
        .highlight {
            background-color: #fff8dc;
            padding: 20px;
            border-left: 5px solid #daa520;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        
        code {
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
            padding: 2px 6px;
            border-radius: 3px;
            font-family: monospace;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <!-- 12+ HTML tags used: html, head, body, title, style, h1, h2, h3, p, ul, ol, li, div, code, strong, em -->
    
    <!-- h1 tag for recipe name - REQUIRED -->
    <h1>🍗 Chicken Adobo</h1>
    
    <!-- p tag for recipe description - REQUIRED -->
    <p>
        <strong>Chicken Adobo</strong> is the iconic Filipino national dish. Tender 
        chicken braised in a savory-tangy sauce of soy sauce, vinegar, garlic, and 
        spices. Perfect with rice! <em>Ready in 1 hour.</em>
    </p>

    <!-- Ingredients section - REQUIRED h2 + ul -->
    <h2>🥘 Ingredients</h2>
    <!-- Unordered list for ingredients - REQUIRED -->
    <ul>
        <li>1kg chicken thighs</li>
        <li>½ cup soy sauce</li>
        <li>½ cup vinegar</li>
        <li>1 head garlic (chopped)</li>
        <li>1 tsp black peppercorns</li>
        <li>3 bay leaves</li>
        <li>1 cup water</li>
        <li>2 tbsp oil</li>
    </ul>

    <!-- Method section - REQUIRED h2 + ol -->
    <h2>🔥 Method</h2>
    <!-- Ordered list for steps - REQUIRED -->
    <ol>
        <li>Brown chicken in hot oil (5 mins)</li>
        <li>Add garlic, cook 1 min</li>
        <li>Pour soy sauce + vinegar + water + spices</li>
        <li>Simmer covered 40 mins</li>
        <li>Uncover, thicken sauce 5 mins</li>
        <li>Serve hot with rice</li>
    </ol>

    <!-- BONUS: Creative styling highlight box with code example -->
    <div class="highlight">
        <h3>💡 Pro Tip</h3>
        <p>
            Don't stir during first 20 minutes! Let vinegar "cook off" properly. 
            Use <code>low heat</code> for tender chicken.
        </p>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
